  "details": "# Quick Menu\n\n## Settings\n\n### Scroll position (Fixed)\n\nIt doesn’t remember the scroll position. But the Audio tab does.\n\n### Categories (Fixed)\n\nWhen expanding a category it scrolls all the way down.\n\n### Advanced Settings\n\nThe settings under Advanced Settings (Near clipping & Horizon adjust) aren't saved.\n\n#### Horizon adjust\n\n* I need to dismiss the warning every time. I'm totally used to it, I don’t need the warnings anymore.\n\n* And everytime I want to use it I need to enable snapping (as this is my preferred setting).\n\n#### Near clipping\n\nSame here, I need to select my preferred setting everytime I start up the game.",
